1
00:00:00,542 --> 00:00:04,403
3,820... nahi. Phir se.

2
00:00:07,576 --> 00:00:10,237
Bhaiya, phone... teesri baar!

3
00:00:10,561 --> 00:00:12,007
Bas, hisaab mil jaaye.

4
00:00:16,934 --> 00:00:20,396
Pari? Beta... Papa aa gaye.

5
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,178
Function khatam, Papa.

6
00:00:23,448 --> 00:00:25,639
Maine stage se aapko bahut dhoondha.

7
00:00:27,009 --> 00:00:29,258
Roz ka yahi hisaab hai, ji.

8
00:00:31,426 --> 00:00:33,432
Raat ka hisaab ab ye jodega.

9
00:00:33,757 --> 00:00:34,321
Aur main?

10
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:37,299
Aap... time pe ghar aaoge.

11
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:41,114
Saadhe aath baje, Pari ka Annual Day.

12
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,686
Cash, UPI, udhaar — apne-aap alag-alag.

13
00:00:49,458 --> 00:00:52,588
Aur munafa bhi... bina calculator.

14
00:00:53,815 --> 00:00:54,931
Cash bhi mil gaya!

15
00:00:55,201 --> 00:00:58,528
8:12... bhaago, Bhaiya!

16
00:00:58,869 --> 00:01:00,203
Shutter tu gira dena!

17
00:01:04,827 --> 00:01:08,780
Pari! Chalo... aage wali seat hamari!

18
00:01:09,849 --> 00:01:12,005
Papa! Aap time pe aa gaye!

19
00:01:13,374 --> 00:01:14,590
Aaj itni jaldi?

20
00:01:14,932 --> 00:01:17,976
Hisaab machine ka... waqt Pari ka.

21
00:01:20,063 --> 00:01:24,280
Din ka hisaab, minuton mein. Nexcod POS.
